      "content": "3.1.1 Legislative Assembly (Vidhan Sabha)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Telangana has a unicameral legislature, but provision exists for a Legislative Council (Vidhan Parishad). The Legislative Assembly has 119 seats.",
      "id": "26h4u30"
    },
